<title>USA: PSE to list options on Affiliated Computer Service.</title>
<headline>PSE to list options on Affiliated Computer Service.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange (PSE) said on Wednesday it will list options on Affiliated Computer Services on Friday, November 29.</p>
<p>Strike prices of 25, 30, and 35 will be listed for the months of December, January, April and July.</p>
<p>Susquehanna Investment Group will be the specialist.</p>
<p>--Chicago Derivatives Desk</p>
<p>E:mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
